<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French</p>
<p>first division after Wednesday's matches:</p>
<p>19 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>18 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes), </p>
<p>17- Japhet N'Doram (Nantes), Sonny Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>16 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon)</p>
<p>15 - Anto Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>12 - Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille)</p>
<p>11- Miladin Becanovic (Lille) </p>
<p>10 - Jocelyn Gourvennec (Nantes), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Lilian Laslandes (Auxerre), Patrice Loko (Paris St Germain),</p>
<p>Ibrahim Bakayoko (Montpellier), Viktor Ikpeba (Monaco)</p>
